  "description": "Buckley Real Estate are delighted to present these spacious, newly refurbished apartment to rent on the ever popular South Circular Road. This magnificent property comes as part of a building that has been completely refurbished to the highest of standards leaving no stone unturned. This spacious, own door apartment briefly consists of an entrance hallway, large living area with a fully fitted kitchen with brand new appliances installed along with a huge amount of over and under head storage space. The double bed and wall mounted fitted wardrobes are an extra bonus. Off the main living area, there is a fully fitted bathroom with fitted shower and sink basins. The apartment also uniquely benefits from sliding glass patio doors into the large back garden of the property, perfect for summer evenings. The property is located at the Portobello end of South Circular Road with endless amenities within a short distance from the property, such as being a short distance from Camden Street, Rathmines and St. Stephens Green. The property also comes as part of a well serviced public transport area making travel to and from the City Centre and North Dublin all the easier.",
